<title>SINGAPORE: Oakwell Engineering interim net up 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Oakwell Engineering interim net up 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.46  vs   0.32</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    0.58  vs   0.41</p>
<p>    Turnover				28.52  vs  22.93</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.21  vs   0.32</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   1.00  vs   0.71</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     0.63  vs   0.54</p>
<p>    Losses from associates	     0.04  vs   0.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 0.58  vs   0.52</p>
<p>    Tax					0.38  vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.27  vs   0.04</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			 -    vs   0.12</p>
<p>Note - The company's full name is Oakwell Engineering Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
